# Hand-written public Swift types of the module Polyjose (platforms/swift/Sources/Polyjose, any file
# but the generated Polyjose.swift), with their public members (scripts/check-binding-api.sh,
# "Host-type lists"; ADR 0071 §5). The swift mode fails on any hand-written public type or member
# not listed here, and on a listed one the sources lack.
#
#   type <Name>      a public type
#     member <name>  one of its public members (func, var, let, init, subscript, nested type, case)
#
# None yet: feature 0025 T03 adds AppleKey (ADR 0072 §1). Adding a type is a review decision, like
# an inventory change.
